chaosshard.servant.kind.miner.desc=Digs a mine at its chest: an open 3×3 shaft down to bedrock with stone steps along the walls; at ore levels (~50, ~28, ~11) a 128-block tunnel with 32-block branches every 3 blocks. Several miners at one chest share the mine.
