item.chaosshard.order_seal.name=Order Seal
chaosshard.order_seal.lore=Wax and gold: an Order captain's seal. Three seals point to the one who hands them out.
chaosshard.order.herald=Order Herald:
chaosshard.order.bannerman=Bearer of Light
chaosshard.order.rise=The Lightbearers have fallen and darkness stands at the gates. From now on the Order marches itself. Every land given to Chaos we shall burn with light.
chaosshard.order.raid.warn=The bells of the capital toll for you, creature. We are coming.
chaosshard.order.raid.start.0=For the King and the Light — forward!
chaosshard.order.raid.start.1=Banner forward! Let the Defilement burn beneath our feet!
chaosshard.order.raid.start.2=Not one step back. The Lightbearers are watching.
chaosshard.order.raid.fall.0=The captain has fallen… Fall back — to the capital!
chaosshard.order.raid.fall.1=The seal… take it, if you can carry it. The King is stronger still.
chaosshard.order.raid.fall.2=Retreat! The Light will return — with the dawn.
chaosshard.order.raid.coming=Order raid, level %s — from X %s, Z %s toward the Anchor at X %s, Z %s. The captain carries a Seal.
chaosshard.order.raid.repelled=The Order captain has fallen, the squad flees. The Anchor grew stronger (+%s Defilement). The Seal is mine.
advancement.chaosshard.m.order_raid.title=Order raid repelled
advancement.chaosshard.m.order_raid.desc=Quest milestone

# ---- Act 5: the capital and the King
item.chaosshard.rift_key.name=Rift Key
chaosshard.rift_key.lore=Cold as the Veil. The gate behind the throne lets its bearer through.
item.chaosshard.royal_crown.name=Crown of Luchezaria
chaosshard.royal_crown.lore=The crown of a King who fell in his own throne room. There is no one left to rule.
tile.chaosshard.capital_barrier.name=Barrier of Light
tile.chaosshard.rift_gate.name=Rift Gate
tile.chaosshard.rift_pylon.name=Pylon Core
entity.chaosshard.king.name=King Aldric
entity.chaosshard.archon.name=The Archon
chaosshard.ritual.omen_crown=Omen of the Crown
chaosshard.ritual.omen_crown.desc=High ritual, sphere, on three Order Seals. Break it in Luchezaria: the Grimoire names where the capital stands, and the capital rises in untouched lands ahead. Only after all five Pillars have fallen.
item.chaosshard.ritual_sphere.omen_crown.name=Sphere of the Crown's Omen
chaosshard.crown.early=The Crown hides behind the Lightbearers. While one Pillar stands, the Omen is silent.
chaosshard.crown.already=The capital is already known: X %s, Z %s — %s blocks.
chaosshard.crown.found=The seals burned and showed the way. Capital of Luchezaria: X %s, Z %s — %s blocks. Walls, four towers with beacons, and a palace sealed by Light.
chaosshard.crown.beacon_guarded=The guards keep the light (%s nearby). Them first.
chaosshard.crown.beacon_need=A beacon is snuffed with %s Chaos Essence in hand.
chaosshard.crown.beacon_out=A beacon of Light went out: %s of %s.
chaosshard.crown.beacon_hard=The beacon holds Light — it cannot be broken, only snuffed with Essence.
chaosshard.crown.barrier=The barrier is held by the tower beacons: %s lit.
chaosshard.crown.open=The last beacon is out — the palace barrier crumbles. The King waits in the throne room.
chaosshard.crown.king_fell=The King has fallen. Thread +%s. Behind the throne, the Rift opened — the Key is mine.
chaosshard.king.intro1=Five of my children fell, and a shadow came into my house. So be it. A King greets his guests standing.
chaosshard.king.intro2=The old man holds his crown like a shield. A crown is no shield. I will tear it off.
chaosshard.king.greet=Kneel, creature, before the face of Luchezaria.
chaosshard.king.decree=DECREE: kneel!
chaosshard.king.decree_broken=You… interrupted the King?
chaosshard.king.guard=Guards! To me!
chaosshard.king.phase2=My children… lend me your strength.
chaosshard.king.echo.0=Kael's Light!
chaosshard.king.echo.1=Irena's prayer!
chaosshard.king.echo.2=Velmor's fire!
chaosshard.king.echo.3=Lian's song, heal me…
chaosshard.king.echo.4=Elis's stride!
chaosshard.king.song_broken=The song… broke off.
chaosshard.king.death=Elis… I am coming… Archon, hold… the Veil…
chaosshard.king.memory=The knot is untied in the Rift. The door is behind his throne. The Archon waits.

# ---- Act 5: the Rift and the Archon
chaosshard.rift.no_key=The gate does not let you through without the Rift Key.
chaosshard.rift.quiet=The Rift is empty. The knot is untied.
chaosshard.archon.shielded=The light of the five Pillars shields the Archon: %s cores intact. Break them.
chaosshard.archon.intro1=The Lord sent a shard. For a thousand years I held the Veil against all of Chaos — and you think a splinter will break it?
chaosshard.archon.intro2=Not a splinter. The last nail. Five Pillars have fallen — only you are holding.
chaosshard.archon.phase2=The Pillars have fallen… Then I shall be the Veil myself.
chaosshard.archon.phase3=You do not understand what you will open. Beyond the Veil is not freedom. Beyond it is HIM.
chaosshard.archon.tear=The Veil tears beneath you — fall into the void!
chaosshard.archon.pylon.0=Kael's light has faded.
chaosshard.archon.pylon.1=Irena's prayer fell silent.
chaosshard.archon.pylon.2=Velmor's fire went cold.
chaosshard.archon.pylon.3=Lian's song broke off.
chaosshard.archon.pylon.4=Elis's guard is scattered.
chaosshard.archon.death=The knot… is untied. Luchezaria… forgive me…
chaosshard.ending.lord=Lord Death
chaosshard.ending.1=The knot is untied. The Veil holds on nothing anymore.
chaosshard.ending.2=Do you hear? That is not thunder. The sky is cracking.
chaosshard.ending.3=Shard. I hear you — for the first time in a thousand years. You did what Chaos could not do for a thousand years.
chaosshard.ending.4=Luchezaria is open. Chaos will enter it like water into a crack — quietly and forever.
chaosshard.ending.5=Rest. You are no longer a shard. You are the door I came through.
chaosshard.ending.6=End of entries. The Grimoire is closed.
